# Committed dev-only defaults, loaded only when APP_ENV=dev (Symfony Dotenv
# loads .env, then .env.local, then .env.$APP_ENV, then .env.$APP_ENV.local —
# each overriding the last).
#
# NOTHING SECRET BELONGS HERE. This file is committed to a public AGPL-3.0
# repository AND it is copied into any image built from this tree, so a value
# here is published twice over. Anything that grants access goes in
# .env.dev.local, which is ignored by both .gitignore and .dockerignore.

###> sendvery/browser-tests ###
# Shared secret for /_test/login, the sign-in bypass the Playwright browser
# suite uses. EMPTY HERE ON PURPOSE: the endpoint signs in as any existing user
# in any team, and "it only answers in dev" is one gate, not two — a dev
# database restored from a production dump is a normal thing to have.
#
# ONE-TIME LOCAL SETUP, before `npx playwright test`:
#
#   echo 'SENDVERY_TEST_LOGIN_SECRET=pick-something-random' > .env.dev.local
#   docker compose restart app
#
# The app reads env files at boot, so a running FrankenPHP worker needs the
# restart. tests/Browser/global-setup.ts prints these two lines if the secret is
# missing.
SENDVERY_TEST_LOGIN_SECRET=
###< sendvery/browser-tests ###
